{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53688","headline":"永嘉百咏 · 张又新","name":"永嘉百咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"滴水泠泠彻碧纱，旱时无减雨无加。\n澄清好是爲官侣，引入孤城一带斜。\n（按：此诗序见明姜准《歧海琐谭》卷十，承张靖龙同志录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张又新","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53688.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53688","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}